    "desc": "Substitute patterns, modify files in-place, delete comment lines & match address ranges",
    "tip": "On macOS (BSD sed), -i requires an argument: sed -i '' 's/.../.../g' file. On Linux (GNU sed), sed -i '...' file works.",
