    "sec": "LACP Bonds & VLANs: Pro Tips & Best Practices",
    "cmd": "cat /proc/net/bonding/bond0 && ip link add link eth0 name eth0.100 type vlan id 100",
    "desc": "High-Availability LACP Aggregation & 802.1Q Tagged VLANs",
